{"text": "The gentleman led Jemima. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To a lonely, gloomy little house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among the foxgloves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was made of sticks and turf. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And two broken buckets. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Made a chimney. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This is my summer house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is more comfortable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than my winter house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind the house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was an old shed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Made of soap boxes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The shed was almost full of feathers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And it was hard to breathe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima was a little surprised. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To see so many feathers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it was soft and comfortable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she made a nest easily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The gentleman promised. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To take great care of her nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every afternoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima came back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she laid nine eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The gentleman liked them very much. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he often counted them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Jemima was away.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "g", "e", "n", "t", "l", "e", "m", "a", "n", " ", "l", "e", "d", " ", "J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "n", "e", "l", "y", ",", " ", "g", "l", "o", "o", "m", "y", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "m", "o", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "x", "g", "l", "o", "v", "e", "s", ".